 "voice": "long-ramayana-hisaab/ch1/voice.wav",
 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.111,
   "text": "Terah din. ₹1,483 crore rupaye. Ramayana is waqt India ki sabse tez kamaane wali filmon mein hai.",
   "end": 7.071
  },
  {
   "start": 7.566,
   "text": "Lekin internet pe do sawaal chal rahe hain. Pehla: kya ye Dangal ka 2,070 crore ka record tod degi?",
   "end": 13.84
  },
  {
   "start": 14.432,
   "text": "Aur doosra sawaal, jo koi theek se nahi pooch raha: is film pe 4,000 crore lage hain. Kya wo paisa wapas aayega?",
   "end": 23.433
  },
  {
   "start": 23.433,
   "text": "Aaj hum kisi ka trade tweet nahi maanenge. Din-ba-din ka data liya hai, aur khud hisaab lagaya hai. Video khatam hote-hote aapke paas teen number honge, jo aap kisi bhi bahas mein screenshot karke bhej sakte ho.",
   "end": 33.31
  }
 ],
